{
  "category": "Intimidation Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can expand the focus of its eyes, enabling it to see objects in the far distance as if it were using binoculars.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its unique faculty of sight can detect small prey more than 30 miles away, even in the midst of a sandstorm.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "After clamping down with its powerful jaws, it twists its body around to rip its prey in half.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it spots prey, even at a distance of over 30 miles, it swims through the desert as if it were water, then jumps out and chomps them.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It conceals itself in sandstorms that Flygon whip up and waits patiently for prey to appear.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon is known as the Bully of the Sands. Krookodile’s mighty jaws can bite through heavy plates of iron with almost no effort at all.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "While terribly aggressive, Krookodile also has the patience to stay hidden under sand for days, lying in wait for prey.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
